<p>On falling below 0 life, you engage an automated repair mode. While in this mode you cannot act, but can survive below <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-50, -251, -405, -535, -650</acronym> life, heal for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 43, 69, 90, 110</acronym> life each turn and have all resistances increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 17%, 25%, 30%, 34%.</acronym> This will last until you are destroyed or until you are fully healed.</p><p>This effect has a cooldown.</p>